{"4290170": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mudventure", "steam_appid": 4290170, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the shifting tides! Become a cute mole, dig through the mud for resources, and repair your ship to survive. Explore ever-changing terrain with friends and flee the island before the sea swallows everything!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 Living 3D Mudflats &amp; Shifting Tides</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Mudventure is never static. Your strategy must change with the real-time ebb and flow of the tide. Explore hidden caves revealed during low tide, but hurry to high ground before the water rushes back! As the tide rises, new paths open while new dangers emerge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/cba3d6ab0e4b9f8883276b858548dc57.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/cba3d6ab0e4b9f8883276b858548dc57.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/cba3d6ab0e4b9f8883276b858548dc57.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⛏️ Limitless Terrain Transformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't just dig—reshape the world. With the <strong>Digger System</strong>, you can freely destroy and mold the mudflat terrain. Carve your own paths to find rare resources deep underground or create efficient escape routes to evade pursuing monsters.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/1d35cfa87ebf76112d391e853d8e9bf5.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/1d35cfa87ebf76112d391e853d8e9bf5.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/1d35cfa87ebf76112d391e853d8e9bf5.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎣 Fish, Gather, and Survive</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mudflats hold more than just dirt. Utilize everything the island offers to aid your escape.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fishing:</strong> Cast your line to catch essential items or rare fish that fetch high prices at the market.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/0d79f238659d5da777ed3b790d69c5f5.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/0d79f238659d5da777ed3b790d69c5f5.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/0d79f238659d5da777ed3b790d69c5f5.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gathering:</strong> Scour the island for mysterious resources. Roam the newly opened &quot;Starfish Island&quot; to collect precious materials for crafting.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/f1136268b67c13b6682f38ecbd009c25.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/f1136268b67c13b6682f38ecbd009c25.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/f1136268b67c13b6682f38ecbd009c25.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔮 The Witch’s Cauldron &amp; Arcane Recipes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft essential survival items using the Witch’s Cauldron. Dig up hidden recipes from the mud or purchase new ones from the shop. The tools and potions you craft will be your only shield against giant monsters and the harsh environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/85ed535425089b658f70193a79167ff0.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/85ed535425089b658f70193a79167ff0.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/85ed535425089b658f70193a79167ff0.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ 5 Giant Bosses &amp; Legendary Ship Parts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Peaceful surfaces hide ancient secrets. To escape, you must repair your broken ship—but its core parts have been swallowed by 5 legendary monsters ruling the island. Defeat them to reclaim what’s yours! Use special gear to track hidden treasures and earn exclusive rewards in deep subterranean caves.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/a19e5772a50a6d6a8108490ab6b0d8be.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/a19e5772a50a6d6a8108490ab6b0d8be.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/a19e5772a50a6d6a8108490ab6b0d8be.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🤝 4-Player Co-op Fun</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with up to 4 players in real-time. Divide roles: one digs, one fishes, and another scouts for monsters. The chaotic escape from the mudflats is always better with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Escape the shifting tides! Become a cute mole, dig through the mud for resources, and repair your ship to survive. Explore ever-changing terrain with friends and flee the island before the sea swallows everything!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌊 Living 3D Mudflats &amp; Shifting Tides</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world of Mudventure is never static. Your strategy must change with the real-time ebb and flow of the tide. Explore hidden caves revealed during low 