 digs, one fishes, and another scouts for monsters. The chaotic escape from the mudflats is always better with friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.poster.avif?t=1786448725\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.webm?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/extras/8bf9090bdffe8e6e3d0c283de02e50c7.mp4?t=1786448725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Mudventure: 4-player co-op survival on shifting 3D mudflats. As a cute mole, dig for resources and repair your ship. Use terrain transformation to carve paths, explore caves during real-time tides, and defeat 5 giant bosses. Escape with friends before the sea swallows the island!", "supported_languages": "English, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, Russian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/e8eed3e92854a6ce4fbc760a031f495361e853a3/header.jpg?t=1786448725", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/345f0597eb5f603055ff612f29e26646d2fafb57/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786448725", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4290170/345f0597eb5f603055ff612f29e26646d2fafb57/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786448725", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li>